{"productId": "0b7cbdf5-6e13-4f0c-aecf-8ecf9a1414f5", "modelName": "Vanguard Synthetic Compact", "modelDescription": "In the 1960's, Roy Weatherby recognized the need for a more affordable rifle that could chamber his signature magnum cartridges. Having just partnered with Howa to produce Mark V actions and seeing the precision and attention to detail that this Japanese manufacture provided, the Vanguard project was born. Starting with a Howa two-lug push-feed action, a number of Weatherby signature safety features were incorporated, including a fully shrouded bolt and three gas ports on the bolt body, both providing protection in the event of an ammunition failure. A hammer forged barrel brought both accuracy and longevity not typically seen in mass-produced cut-rifled barrels of the day, while the M-16 style extractor gives great purchase on the cartridge rim for consistent and reliable extraction. A fluted bolt body similar to the Mark V creates smoother operation when the rigors of the hunt leave the rifle dusty and dirty. The result was a smooth-running push-feed capable of handling Weatherby Magnums at a price more Americans could afford. The modern Vanguard carries a Sub-MOA accuracy guarantee and ships with a crisp two-stage trigger, making it what feels like what's the best value in the rifle market today. A Monte Carlo stock provides lightweight and durable performance year after year. Its one-piece forged and machined receiver features integral recoil lug for the utmost in strength and structural integrity. One-piece trigger guard with hinged floorplate provides easy access to unfired cartridges in the magazine. The Vanguard rifle also features a specially-fit, low density recoil pad. This technologically superior material significantly reduces felt recoil. Lastly, the three-position safety allows shooter to work the action while safety is still engaged. The Compact model becomes the perfect fit for whoever wants to experience SUB-MOA accuracy from its 20 bead-blasted barrel. That length-of-pull adjustability, along with the great price, makes this rifle a popular pick for parents who are raising their kids in the sporting life.\n\n", "manufacturerName": "Weatherby", "subProducts": [{"isFirearm": true, "isNfa": false, "subProductId": "337b5d63-d933-45d4-8da2-b863f74c3023", "description": "Weatherby, Vanguard Synthetic Compact, Bolt Action, 6.5 Creedmoor, 20\" Barrel, Matte Blued Finish, Black Synthetic Monte Carlo Stock, Right Hand, 4 Round Capacity", "imageUrls": ["https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/4a553029-3154-40bc-9289-afccefd39194", "https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/a7eb8789-e05e-47ce-8471-f5b4d241899f"], "isDefault": false, "manufacturerPartNumber": "VYT65CMR0T", "upc": "747115456550", "attributes": [{"attributeNameId": "5978af0e-1de2-4b6e-9b64-b8c25e2e8d70", "attributeName": "Caliber", "attributeValueId": "c520d412-a05d-43d2-84e0-ed20d092026b", "valueName": "6.5 Creedmoor"}, {"attributeNameId": "2765db68-a9f0-406d-8fb7-5b572b01f4ee", "attributeName": "Capacity", "attributeValueId": "6b3d3954-66c5-49c2-9c97-0ed1ede9999c", "valueName": "4 Round"}, {"attributeNameId": "7c11c5f3-970e-4119-9b86-521429f6df57", "attributeName": "Stock Type", "attributeValueId": "1fbeb5bd-0846-49da-853a-9c08ed796a87", "valueName": "Synthetic"}, {"attributeNameId": "6de54e07-e352-463c-bf38-3079da1974f9", "attributeName": "Factory Equipped Sights", "attributeValueId": "58b272c7-0c5c-40f2-a6f8-b83b1071cc15", "valueName": "None"}, {"attributeNameId": "c8cd558c-27d3-4d9a-9936-eb7c87c5ba92", "attributeName": "Color", "attributeValueId": "489958cc-0acf-432b-a36b-80107a101b7e", "valueName": "Blued"}, {"attributeNameId": "2ec4f4e1-4aed-47a2-bb02-cd7f86849836", "attributeName": "Hand", "attributeValueId": "324e63b7-c8e9-47bd-898b-de0f8eaa7ff6", "valueName": "Right"}, {"attributeNameId": "dc7a7e89-2701-44c0-a795-288bc55143bb", "attributeName": "Barrel Length", "attributeValueId": "bc23294e-268d-44d0-9d70-3969474